20
00:01:16,253 --> 00:01:21,458
Retention in days says how long recordings are kept before they may be erased.

21
00:01:21,458 --> 00:01:23,318
Zero keeps them forever.

22
00:01:23,318 --> 00:01:29,143
Apply legal hold by default makes new recordings undeletable until the hold is released.

23
00:01:29,605 --> 00:01:34,525
Allow agents to pause recording shows a Pause recording button in the agent

24
00:01:34,525 --> 00:01:38,777
